      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/f/fdd34c51a017339f0e1947ee77e175f614a32a0e.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/fdd34c51a017339f0e1947ee77e175f614a32a0e\" title=\"dspiration rules back\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/fdd34c51a017339f0e1947ee77e175f614a32a0e_2_323x500.jpeg\" alt=\"dspiration rules back\" data-base62-sha1=\"AdrvfZbUD3dwOXhURl9WaPRF7UW\" width=\"323\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/fdd34c51a017339f0e1947ee77e175f614a32a0e_2_323x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/fdd34c51a017339f0e1947ee77e175f614a32a0e_2_484x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/fdd34c51a017339f0e1947ee77e175f614a32a0e_2_646x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"BCB6A8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">dspiration rules back</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×2963 756 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>here is the advertisement for the next expansion from the back of the Dispiration rulebook.<br>\nChristopher and Adam have said that the plans have changed so we will not be getting this right away. But we should get everything one day</p>\n<p>Male hero Naturalist<br>\nFemale hero only 3 clawed fingers, no cape not Young Legacy, no bone spurs not Skyscraper</p>\n<p>villains left to right<br>\nBusy Body’s combat tentacles<br>\nspindly clawer hand ?<br>\nProletariat with Hammer<br>\nGun ? Greezer?<br>\nClawed hand ? does this hand belong to the gunner?<br>\nFist ? Vengeful Blade sleaves seem too lose and flowy<br>\nEnergized hand ?</p>",
